  "details": "An optional toggle for the world search bar to keep what you've typed after you left the menu? Maybe I want to look at castles so I search \"castle\". Whenever I leave the menu by joining a world or backing out of the menu, I have to retype the same phrase every time. I know there is a copy/paste feature there, however that adds one more step each time, if we even remember to do it. A little \"keep searched\" check box next to the search bar would be awesome!",
